and surveillance of his AAA?','{"A":"A. MRI angiography.","B":"B. CT angiography.","C":"OC. Ultrasonography.","D":"D. Digital subtraction angiography.","E":"E. Non-contrast abdominal CT scan."}','C','Ultrasonography is the most accurate and the best investigation for diagnosing, screening, and
