thin dermis. This type accounts for a majority of\nbenign congenital nevi.\n\n¢ Junctional nevus: the nevus cells are located at the junction of the basal epidermal layers and\ndermis.\n\n¢ Combined nevus: nevus cells are both intradermal and junctional.\n\n(Option A) Solar (actinic) keratosis is usually a raised plaque usually on sun-exposed area of the\nskin. It is a precursor of SCC.\n\n(Option B) Leukoplakia is whitish lesion in the oral cavity and associated with SCC.\n(Option D) Bowen disease is considered SCC in situ, and is malignant.\n\n(Option E) Chronic radiation dermatitis may result in SCC.","source_answer_status":"present","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"low","currentness_keywords":[],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"medium","parser_mode":"v27_same_page_five_structural","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"d17544bbe8e7b2c753764018b5fee58dde599f3f","duplicate_group_id":"exact-d17544bbe8e7","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"f65346fafe5ed193d048","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Dermatology amedex 2025.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Dermatology amedex 2025.pdf","source_page":43,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"9db8a77228bf06470694","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 DERMATOLOGY 1-60.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 DERMATOLOGY 1-60.pdf","source_page":61,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"26624951704fa1d25343","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":200,"source_qid":"61"}]}',1,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_