ay be found\non a digital rectal exam.\n\n(Option C) Abdominal aortic aneurysm (AAA) is a disease seen in older male patients. Rupture of an AAA may present similarly; however,\nthe age and gender of this patient make this diagnosis very unlikely.\n\n(Option E) Acute appendicitis presents with vague periumbilical pain that gradually localizes in the right lower quadrant. Symptoms of\nperitonitis and shock develop later following rupture of the inflamed appendix. Acute appendicitis is a very unlikely explanation for this\npresentation.","source_answer_status":"present","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"high","currentness_keywords":["age","contracept","dose","pregnan"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"medium","parser_mode":"v27_same_page_five_structural","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"33107106831c9d5ada587649b1ce5668501c9d30","duplicate_group_id":"exact-33107106831c","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"3ae68c5887a62863b01f","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Git amedex 2025.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Git amedex 2025.pdf","source_page":7,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"1ce61191f946def2d00f","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 GIT 1-40.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 GIT 1-40.pdf","source_page":10,"source_qid":null}]}',1,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk,record_json=excluded.record_json,active_quiz=excluded.active_quiz,import_version=excluded.import_version,imported_at=excluded.imported_at;
