most appropriate investigation for him.\n\n(Option A) CT colonography is a new, safe, and well-tolerated tool for diagnosing colonic polyps and masses. When performed by experienced hands, it is\nas accurate as a traditional colonoscopy. However, cost and training issues must be addressed before it is widely accepted beyond the current indications\nof incomplete colonoscopy or patients unfit to undergo optic colonoscopy.\n\n(Options B and C) CT scan of the abdomen and pelvis is not an effective tool for surveillance of colorectal adenomas. It is used, however, in cases of\ncolorectal cancer to assess the extent of the disease and staging. Rectal ultrasound is not an assessment tool for surveillance of colorectal adenomas. It is\nneither sensitive nor specific.\n\n(Option E) Serum tumor markers such as AFP and CEA are used if the diagnosis is invasive carcinoma. These markers assess the tumor burden and\nmonitor for any post-treatment recurrence.","source_answer_status":"present","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"high","currentness_keywords":["guideline","interval","treatment"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"medium","parser_mode":"v27_same_page_five_structural","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"2bef43c5ceaad21128cdaab2ed12b62c3e6e829e","duplicate_group_id":"exact-2bef43c5ceaa","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"3dd4ae4d08494dcd1685","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Git amedex 2025.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Git amedex 2025.pdf","source_page":11,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"37c1e97c39b63868ea17","record_type":"visual_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 GIT 1-40.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 GIT 1-40.pdf","source_page":123,"source_qid":null}]}',1,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE S