from disruption of the pancreatic duct with fistulization to the chest.\n\n¢ Pancreatic pleural effusion: can be caused by disruption of the pancreatic duct with fistulization to the abdomen.\n\nNOTE - up to 40% of pseudocysts resolve without intervention; however, they can produce a wide range of clinical problems depending on the\nlocation and extent of the fluid collection and the presence of infection.\n\nPancreatitis pseudocysts are diagnosed with a CT or ultrasound scan. If the diagnosis is in doubt, contents can be aspirated and examined.\n\nThe dictum mentioning that intervention is needed if the cysts are larger than 6 cm or persist beyond six weeks is no longer in use, and surgical\nintervention should be considered in the presence of any of the following criteria:\n\n¢ Compression of large vessels (clinical symptoms or seen on CT scan)\n¢ Gastric or duodenal outlet obstruction\n\n¢ Stenosis of the common bile duct due to compression\n\n¢ Infected pancreatic pseudocysts\n\n¢ Hemorrhage into pancreatic pseudocyst\n\n¢ Pancreatic-pleural fistula\n\n¢ Pancreatic pseudocysts and symptoms:","source_answer_status":"present","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"medium","currentness_keywords":["age","management"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"medium","parser_mode":"v27_same_page_five_structural","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"9b3b5506a57238561f9299231020dc0eee5a2cd3","duplicate_group_id":"exact-9b3b5506a572","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"4cb15dc74bf90c1bb50c","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Git amedex 2025.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Git amedex 2025.pdf","source_page":33,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"a0e04a958e04a737c397","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 GIT 41-75.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 GIT 41-75.pdf","source_page":150,"source_qid":null}]}',1,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk,record_json=excluded.record_json,active_quiz=excluded.active_quiz,import_version=excluded.import_version,imported_at=excluded.imported_at;
